MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5d2a2c86d3a2389439aadb19681071f6, type: 3}
  m_Name: CutSceneDatabase
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _cutSceneDataDict:
    m_Keys: 0000000001000000020000000300000004000000050000000600000007000000
    m_Values:
    - PlayerDialogueList:
      - I may be young, but my heart is ready. I trained for this moment all my life.
      - Maybe. But faith moves mountains. I believe God put me here for a reason.
      - "Win or lose, I fight for my country \u2014 for every Filipino who dreams."
      EnemyDialogueList:
      - "You\u2019ve got speed, kid. But experience wins fights."
      - "Then let\u2019s see whose reason is stronger."
    - PlayerDialogueList:
      - 
      - "Maybe not ready in your eyes, but I\u2019m ready in my heart. I trained
        like this is my only chance."
      - "Then you\u2019ll bring out the best in me. That\u2019s all I ask \u2014
        a chance to show what hard work and faith can do."
      - "Then get ready, champ. Because tonight, I\u2019m not leaving without that
        belt."
      - "I won\u2019t. I fight for my family, for my people, and for God. He gives
        me strength."
      EnemyDialogueList:
      - "You came in late, kid. You\u2019re not ready for a champion."
      - "This is my division. I\u2019ve been champion for a reason."
      - "You\u2019ve got spirit. Don\u2019t let it break you."
    - PlayerDialogueList:
      - 
      - "I know, Champ. But I didn\u2019t come here just to be fast \u2014 I came
        here to give everything I have"
      - "\u201CI respect you. You\u2019re a great fighter. But I believe God gives
        us strength for a reason \u2014 and tonight, I\u2019ll use mine."
      - "Always. Because I fight not only for myself \u2014 but for my country, for
        my people, and for every Filipino dreamer watching tonight."
      EnemyDialogueList:
      - "You\u2019re fast, kid. But speed alone won\u2019t save you tonight."
      - Many have tried to take me down. None succeeded easily.
      - Then fight like a warrior.
    - PlayerDialogueList:
      - 
      - "I respect that. But I don\u2019t depend only on power \u2014 I depend on
        faith, discipline, and heart."
      - "Experience is strong \u2014 but hunger is stronger. I came from nothing,
        and I\u2019ll fight like it."
      - "Yes. Tonight, I fight for my people and for God \u2014 the source of my
        strength."
      EnemyDialogueList:
      - "I\u2019ve studied you. You\u2019re strong, but I\u2019ve been preparing
        for months for this moment"
      - "We\u2019ll see if your heart can match my experience."
      - "Then we\u2019ll give the fans what they came for."
    - PlayerDialogueList:
      - 
      - "I respect your strength. But I believe I\u2019m stronger because I\u2019ve
        trained and prepared with heart."
      - "We\u2019ll both be tested. But I come for more than the belt \u2014 for
        my people, for hope."
      EnemyDialogueList:
      - "You\u2019re moving up in weight, young man. You\u2019ll feel strength you\u2019ve
        not felt before."
      - "I\u2019m built for this weight. I will make you pay for moving up."
    - PlayerDialogueList:
      - 
      - "I respect you, Ricky. You\u2019re a great fighter. But I believe we\u2019re
        here to give the world something special."
      - "I will. Let\u2019s make it a fight to remember."
      EnemyDialogueList:
      - "You\u2019re the hype, Pacquiao. But I am the reality here. I\u2019ve been
        champion, I\u2019ve been tested."
      - "Then show me. Let\u2019s fight."
    - PlayerDialogueList:
      - 
      - "I know your power. I\u2019ve prepared to face it. My speed, my faith \u2014
        they carry me. I fight not just for myself, but for everyone who believes."
      - "I will. Let\u2019s make it a fight to remember."
      EnemyDialogueList:
      - "You\u2019ve moved up again. I\u2019m the naturally bigger man. I\u2019ve
        been at this weight. I\u2019ll test your heart tonight."
      - Then show me what that faith means in this ring.
    - PlayerDialogueList:
      - 
      - "I know the challenge. But I believe when you train with purpose, when you
        carry your people\u2019s hopes, weight becomes just a number. I come with
        heart, with faith, with purpose."
      - 
      EnemyDialogueList:
      - "You\u2019re stepping into a higher division. I\u2019ve fought big men. I
        will pressure you, make this heavy."
      - Then fight like it.
